<title>FRANCE: Two wheat ships expected in Rouen by January 23.</title>
<headline>Two wheat ships expected in Rouen by January 23.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two ships are expected in Rouen by January 23 to load some 40,000 tonnes of wheat, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Destinations were not available.</p>
<p>Six ships are currently at Rouen, loading 76,000 tonnes of wheat for Algeria, Greece, Italy and Madagascar.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
